{
  "uid": "eat-traces",
  "title": "eat — Traces (Tempo)",
  "description": "資料全部來自 Tempo，用 TraceQL 查。上排是從 trace 算出來的數字（TraceQL metrics），下排是一筆一筆的請求清單，點 Trace ID 就打開那個請求的瀑布圖。只挑 /api/chat，只看提問本身（actuator 的抓取與健康檢查在 app 端就不產生 trace，見 ObservationConfiguration）。",
  "tags": [
    "eat",
    "traces",
    "tempo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "提問速率 (req/s)",
      "description": "{name=\"http post /api/chat\"} | rate() —— 直接從 trace 數出來的每秒提問數。跟 eat-app 儀表板從指標算的那張應該對得起來：同一批請求，一份記成數字、一份記成 trace。用 span 名稱篩而不是 span.uri：根 span 用 uri 屬性篩在 Tempo 3 上查不到東西。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "metricsQueryType": "range",
          "query": "{name=\"http post /api/chat\"} | rate()"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "displayName": "/api/chat",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "時間花在哪一段 (p95)",
      "description": "{name=\"http post /api/chat\" || span.port != nil} | quantile_over_time(duration, .95) by (name) —— 整個請求（http post /api/chat），以及 core 往外呼叫的兩個 port：retrievePassages（檢索：問題轉向量、挑片段）、generateReply（生成）。這是 trace 才答得出來的問題 —— 指標只知道整個請求多慢，trace 知道慢在哪一段。port 的 span 由 ObservationConfiguration 的 aspect 產生，每個都帶 span.port 屬性，所以用「有沒有 span.port」挑出來。注意 TraceQL 的分位數是用 2 的次方分桶估的（0.5s、1s、2s…），只適合看量級和趨勢，要精準數字看 eat-app 儀表板。寫成一條查詢、用 by (name) 分線，而不是一段一條查詢：這版 Grafana 的 Tempo 資料源在同一個 panel 裡只會送出第一條 TraceQL metrics 查詢。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "metricsQueryType": "range",
          "query": "{name=\"http post /api/chat\" || span.port != nil} | quantile_over_time(duration, .95) by (name)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "always"
          },
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.name}"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "沒成功的 span 數",
      "description": "{resource.service.name=\"eat\" && (span.outcome != \"SUCCESS\" || status = error)} | count_over_time() by (name) —— 兩種失敗一起數：請求本身沒成功（outcome 是 Spring 標的 CLIENT_ERROR、SERVER_ERROR，例如空白問題回 400），以及某個 port 呼叫丟了例外（span 狀態 error，例如 llama.cpp 沒開）。依 span 名稱分開，看得出是哪一段出事。平常沒資料是正常的。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "metricsQueryType": "range",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"eat\" && (span.outcome != \"SUCCESS\" || status = error)} | count_over_time() by (name)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "最近的提問",
      "description": "最近 20 筆 /api/chat。點 Trace ID 打開瀑布圖，看這一次檢索、生成各花多久；瀑布圖上再點「Logs for this span」就跳到 Loki 看它的 access log（問了什麼、回了什麼）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{name=\"http post /api/chat\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "慢的提問 (> 5 秒)",
      "description": "{name=\"http post /api/chat\" && duration > 5s} —— 長尾在這裡。通常是 Qwen3 的 thinking 生太多 token，點開看是不是幾乎整段都在 /v1/chat/completions。門檻 5 秒跟 Loki 那條慢請求查詢一致。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{name=\"http post /api/chat\" && duration > 5s}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "沒成功的請求",
      "description": "上面那張「沒成功的 span 數」的明細：一筆一筆列出來，點開看是哪一段出事。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"eat\" && (span.outcome != \"SUCCESS\" || status = error)}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    }
  ]
}
